      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Unknown",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a48d248ef60073948d92",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>My reading of various W3C documents suggests that RDF should always be UTF-8; however, that conflicts with the HTTP/1.1 specification that states that any content type of \"text/\" is, by default (w/o a charset parameter), ISO-8859-1. The suggested resolution is that, for all RDF serializations that begin with \"text/\", there should be a charset=utf-8 parameter in the Content-Type header. For serializations that begin with \"application/\", the utf-8 charset is implied (e.g. application/ld+json or application/n-triples).</p>\n\n<p>I would suggest that for any Fedora response that begins with \"text/\", there should also be a charset=utf-8 parameter. This would apply to:</p>\n\n<p>text/turtle<br/>\ntext/plain (n-triples)<br/>\ntext/n3<br/>\ntext/rdf+n3<br/>\ntext/html</p>\n\n<p>Here are the relevant documents:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/2008/01/rdf-media-types\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.w3.org/2008/01/rdf-media-types</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/turtle/#sec-mime\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.w3.org/TR/turtle/#sec-mime</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/International/articles/http-charset/index\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.w3.org/International/articles/http-charset/index</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TeamSubmission/n3/#encoding\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.w3.org/TeamSubmission/n3/#encoding</a></p>",
     "created": "07/Oct/16 1:36 PM",
